{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123637","id":4578304228,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEONg5A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123637","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123637.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123637.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123637","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123637/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123637/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123637/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2662d656322607f2764d9ff53127295303ca73f2","number":123637,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix node name casing before child name validation","user":{"login":"hukultan","id":217990987,"node_id":"U_kgDODP5HSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217990987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan","html_url":"https://github.com/hukultan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hukultan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123573\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThis patch changes the order of instructions in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp#L3171-L3175 to get the actual name of the child node with `child->get_name()` to correct the name casing before prevalidating and setting it with set_name(). Resulting with the child node's name having the corresponding suffix and numbering before it is added.\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\nTestNode → test_node\r\nenters as test_node2\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\nTestNode → test_node2\r\nenters as test_node2\r\n\r\nUsed some AI to find the bug's root cause, first checking in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/main/node.cpp and finally in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp to not rewrite the already existing architecture. Afterwards it proposed and developed the fix to the corresponding code paths.\r\nAfter testing with different options for the `editor/naming/node_name_casing` setting, changing the `class_name` \"Test\" to \"test\" and using the multi-word \"TestNode\" name, i can say that the behavior is correct from a technical and practical standpoint now.\r\nConstructive comments are welcomed.\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA=="